# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
*.user

# ─────────────────────────── Secrets ───────────────────────────
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Nothing with a real credential in it may be
# committed. appsettings.json stays tracked ON PURPOSE -- it documents the
# shape of the config and every secret value in it is blank. Real values live
# in User Secrets (local) or environment variables (production); see SETUP.md.
#
# The entries below are the files people reach for when they are in a hurry.
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
secrets.json
*.env
.env
.env.*

# VAPID keys for Web Push, if anyone writes them to a file rather than secrets
vapid*.json
vapid*.txt
